  1. GOLDSTONE CHECK  max |L0 (r f)| / scale = 3.178e-05
     L0 annihilates the background ANALYTICALLY (L0 f = 0 is the
     background equation), so this number is pure discretisation --
     it is the floor against which every other eigenvalue is read,
     not a pass/fail. Lowest |eigenvalue| of L_x^sym over the scan is
     1.152e-01, i.e. 3623x above it, so the index is resolved.

  2. FLAVOUR / PHASE CHANNELS
     min eigenvalue of L_x^flav over the scan : 3.4764e-02  (>=0 required) PASS
     lowest eigenvalue of L0     over the scan : -5.5932e-06
       this IS the Goldstone, analytically exactly 0 (L0 f = 0), so the
       value is the discretisation floor. Negative directions of L0
       beyond that floor: 0  PASS
     -> n(H_omega) is carried entirely by the SYMMETRIC channel,
        now established AT g = 0.050 rather than assumed from g = 0.

